    "user_request_original": "Design a 29-layer planar multilayer filter coating on fused silica (SiO2 (Gao)) substrate with air incidence. Use only hfo2 and MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) as coating materials in the following fixed sequence from air side: HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2. Optimize all 29 layer thicknesses as independent variables. Target: maximize transmittance in 255-280 nm wavelength band, minimize transmittance in 300-700 nm band, minimize transmittance in 700-1100 nm band. Normal incidence, unpolarized light. No metal layers. Total layer count fixed at 29.",
